@startuml
title Spotify 연동 Use Case
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "비회원" as Guest
actor "일반 회원" as Member
actor "Spotify 연동 회원" as SpotifyMember
actor "Spotify API" as SpotifyAPI

Member --|> Guest
SpotifyMember --|> Member

rectangle "Spotify 연동" {
  usecase "UC-017\nSpotify 곡 검색\n(FR-017)" as UC017
  usecase "UC-018\nSpotify OAuth 연결\n(FR-018)" as UC018 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-019\nSpotify 플레이리스트 생성\n(FR-019)" as UC019 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-020\nSpotify 내보내기\n(FR-019)" as UC020 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-021\nSpotify 플레이리스트 가져오기\n(FR-020)" as UC021 <<partial>>
}

Guest --> UC017
Member --> UC017
SpotifyMember --> UC018
SpotifyMember --> UC020
SpotifyMember --> UC021

SpotifyAPI --> UC017
SpotifyAPI --> UC018
SpotifyAPI --> UC019
SpotifyAPI --> UC020
SpotifyAPI --> UC021

UC020 ..> UC018 : <<include>>
UC020 ..> UC019 : <<include>>
UC021 ..> UC018 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC017
  검색 API와 내부 DB 저장 API는 구현됨.
  검색 결과의 BPM/장르는 null 가능.
end note

note right of UC018
  실제 OAuth 성공은 Spotify 앱 설정,
  redirect URI, 사용자 동의에 의존한다.
end note

note right of UC020
  모든 수록곡의 Spotify URI,
  playlist-modify scope,
  rate limit 영향을 받는다.
end note
@enduml
